<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs - Monday actual 98,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs - Monday actual 98,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog marketings Monday totaled 98,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA said. Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales of Barrows and Gilts were $1.00 per cwt higher than the midsession Monday.</p>
